# Local-only starter. Copy to .dev.vars and replace the passphrase before sharing the app beyond your computer.
# In production set it as a Worker secret instead:  npx wrangler secret put HOST_PASSPHRASE
HOST_PASSPHRASE=change-this-local-passphrase

# Training Studio admin workspace (?view=admin). Use a different, longer value than the presenter passphrase.
# Production:  npx wrangler secret put ADMIN_PASSPHRASE
ADMIN_PASSPHRASE=change-this-admin-passphrase

# No AI provider keys are needed. Prompt Battle uses peer voting only.
